{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Jovian Drive, you'll be driving across the four\u00a0Galilean moons of Jupiter! The routes are easy but the distances are not. Gaze upon the moon-filled skies of the Jovian system as complete jobs that take anywhere from 30 minutes to several hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each moon has it's own unique mechanics! Wow!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Callisto</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/5cabdd69e7f4f7f0aeb4fe78faa64b2f.poster.avif?t=1747360883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/5cabdd69e7f4f7f0aeb4fe78faa64b2f.webm?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/5cabdd69e7f4f7f0aeb4fe78faa64b2f.mp4?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take it easy on the distant moon of Callisto! This is the perfect place to adjust to your new life as a Jovian Driver, as this place has no extra challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ganymede</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/8bbca35b308d7fa1056b5fecd1251626.poster.avif?t=1747360883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/8bbca35b308d7fa1056b5fecd1251626.webm?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/8bbca35b308d7fa1056b5fecd1251626.mp4?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love long drives, you'll love Ganymede! The largest moon of our Solar System is home to the longest drives in Jovian Drive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Europa</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/2b74b79b3b90a4fc0ee87a6badc4f78f.poster.avif?t=1747360883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/2b74b79b3b90a4fc0ee87a6badc4f78f.webm?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/2b74b79b3b90a4fc0ee87a6badc4f78f.mp4?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip and slide (or try not to, rather) across the slick surfaces of the icy moon, Europa! Also, there's water plumes! Those are fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Io</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/cbc70b7d39d6b7e6f4a9ac89ec88e861.poster.avif?t=1747360883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/cbc70b7d39d6b7e6f4a9ac89ec88e861.webm?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/cbc70b7d39d6b7e6f4a9ac89ec88e861.mp4?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye and/or ear out for eruption warnings on the volcanic moon, Io! Close your vehicle's protective shutters and do your best to drive blind until it clears up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your vehicle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every job you complete will unlock you a new customization option for your vehicle! Short jobs will get you stickers, medium jobs will get you interior colors, and long jobs will get you little dangle-y toys to hang from your mirror!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try not to lose your mind, please.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on some music, a podcast, or call your friends and make it a little road trip! You can also just listen to the sound of your engine if you really want, but you might lose your mind by the four-hour mark or so.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635290?t=1747360883","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/35ac4de131e3d8cfec51626317c7063486b64fe7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747360883","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/439384b63850f280387185a3db7483afcf7ca4a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747360883","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/439384b63850f280387185a3db7483afcf7ca4a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747360883","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Jovian Drive, you'll be driving across the four\u00a0Galilean moons of Jupiter! The routes are easy but the distances are not. Gaze upon the moon-filled skies of the Jovian system as complete jobs that take anywhere from 30 minutes to several hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each moon has it's own unique mechanics! Wow!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Callisto</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/5cabdd69e7f4f7f0aeb4fe78faa64b2f.poster.avif?t=1747360883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/5cabdd69e7f4f7f0aeb4fe78faa64b2f.webm?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/5cabdd69e7f4f7f0aeb4fe78faa64b2f.mp4?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take it easy on the distant moon of Callisto! This is the perfect place to adjust to your new life as a Jovian Driver, as this place has no extra challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ganymede</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/8bbca35b308d7fa1056b5fecd1251626.poster.avif?t=1747360883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/8bbca35b308d7fa1056b5fecd1251626.webm?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/8bbca35b308d7fa1056b5fecd1251626.mp4?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love long drives, you'll love Ganymede! The largest moon of our Solar System is home to the longest drives in Jovian Drive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Europa</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/2b74b79b3b90a4fc0ee87a6badc4f78f.poster.avif?t=1747360883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/2b74b79b3b90a4fc0ee87a6badc4f78f.webm?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/2b74b79b3b90a4fc0ee87a6badc4f78f.mp4?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip and slide (or try not to, rather) across the slick surfaces of the icy moon, Europa! Also, there's water plumes! Those are fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Io</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/cbc70b7d39d6b7e6f4a9ac89ec88e861.poster.avif?t=1747360883\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/cbc70b7d39d6b7e6f4a9ac89ec88e861.webm?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/extras/cbc70b7d39d6b7e6f4a9ac89ec88e861.mp4?t=1747360883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye and/or ear out for eruption warnings on the volcanic moon, Io! Close your vehicle's protective shutters and do your best to drive blind until it clears up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your vehicle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every job you complete will unlock you a new customization option for your vehicle! Short jobs will get you stickers, medium jobs will get you interior colors, and long jobs will get you little dangle-y toys to hang from your mirror!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try not to lose your mind, please.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on some music, a podcast, or call your friends and make it a little road trip! You can also just listen to the sound of your engine if you really want, but you might lose your mind by the four-hour mark or so.</p>","developers":["Caseyfromspace"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635290/f99f0dd7a988cab168a1b45007609c9500eec2ce/header.jpg?t=1747360883","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3635290/863757/95b8b66347ae24c1e8546ee4beb51fbd215bdd56/1750407617/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743851479","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3635290/863757/95b8b66347ae24c1e8546ee4beb51fbd215bdd56/1750407617/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743851479","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3635290/863757/95b8b66347ae24c1e8546ee4beb51fbd215bdd56/1750407617/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743851479","id":257122197,"name":"Jovian Drive (Trailer)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122197/2b31b8702385b9a9bbbbbd308b4887afead6fd76/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743851479"}],"name":"Jovian Drive","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Jovian Drive - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99</span> $2.49 USD","packageid":1281368,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-50% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":249}],"title":"Buy Jovian Drive"}],"packages":[1281368],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10 or later<br></li><l